  "changes": [
    "Core adds contextual liability_present and liability_amount intrinsics with one quoted literal and source-wide fixed identity.",
    "Core reads inspect the current statement snapshot. Missing rows return false/0, while present-zero rows return true/0.",
    "Ordinary backend lowering aliases constrained current presence and amount wires without adding public slots.",
    "Escrow compares both incoming duties with remaining and remaining*price before effects. Funding refuses existing duties, including zero tombstones.",
    "CLI inspect describes supplied current duty reads and retains open ledger-authentication premises.",
    "Ledger-call admission and defensive lowering explicitly refuse unsupported duty reads."
  ],
